<script setup lang="ts">import { onMounted, ref } from 'vue'; import { api } from '../api'; import type { AuditLog } from '../types'; const logs=ref<AuditLog[]>([]); onMounted(async()=>logs.value=await api('/api/admin/audit-logs'))</script>
<template><div class="page-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY TRAIL</span><h1>后台审计日志</h1><p>登录、商户、凭据、用户和交易敏感操作留痕。</p></div></div><article class="card"><table><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>操作者</th><th>动作</th><th>目标</th><th>结果</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="item in logs" :key="item.id"><td>{{ new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleString() }}</td><td>{{ item.actorUsername }}<small>{{ item.sourceIp }}</small></td><td class="mono">{{ item.action }}</td><td>{{ item.targetType }} {{ item.targetId || '' }}</td><td><span :class="['badge', item.result.toLowerCase()]">{{ item.result }}</span></td><td>{{ item.detail }}</td></tr></tbody></table><div v-if="!logs.length" class="empty">暂无审计记录。</div></article></template>
